Lets add an `!ls` import modifier that used with star / glob imports. The modifier will cause
all imported files of the import to be inserted into a <FILE_LIST> xml tag in CSV format.

Example:
<FILE_LIST>
``` csv
path, size, head
path/to/file, 766, "This is the start of the documentation of this file\nThis is a new line"
path/to/other-file, 987, "Here are more docs\nThis is a new line"
```
</FILE_LIST>

The `head` column should contain the first 200 characters of the file. The character count should be configurable: `!ls:1000`

paths should be relative to the current file.

The `!ls` modifier should be caused separately similar to the `!docs` modifier

