</FILE_CONTENT>

Summary:
- **Columns**
  - `path` uses `relativeName ?? filePath ?? name`, the same values that `!file` passes to `applyConvoImportTag`. It is only quoted when it contains special characters.
  - `size` is the character length of the full file content.
  - `head` is always quoted. Inner quotes are doubled and newlines are written as a literal `\n`.
- **`!ls:N`** sets the number of head characters. The default is 200.
- **Ranges** are applied to the head content without the `FILE_CONTENT_RANGE` wrappers. They are then removed from `registerModifiers` so `registerModuleAsync` doesn't apply them again.
- **Other modifiers**
  - `!tag`, `!file`, `!merge` and `!docs` are ignored when `!ls` is present.
  - `!role` and `as` assignment still work, because `registerModuleAsync` handles them.


